Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:39:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 91/91] PlaitOS: charging limit with full-before-alarm

PlaitChargeLimitService sets sys.plait.charge_* properties from the Charging limit
settings; init (vendor/plait/chargelimit) writes them to the Pixel charger, since the
platform may not touch its sysfs. The alarm mode is LineageOS's deadline charging: a
nine-hour window and the alarm handed to the charger as its charge_deadline.

